WEBVTT

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:12.594
[cat meowing]

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:27.025
[meows]

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.737
I think we got off
to a bad start.

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.281
The name's Wolf.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.575
[shrieks]

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:36.785
Yep. [sighs]

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:39.913
I get that a lot,
first impressions and all.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:44.793
- [agitated meowing]
- No, no, no!

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.671
[yowling]

00:00:47.755 --> 00:00:49.756
[panting]

00:00:52.844 --> 00:00:55.220
It's okay, it's okay.
I'm not gonna hurt you.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:57.723
I know you're scared.
I would be, too, if I were you.

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:00.851
Just give me a chance.

00:01:01.936 --> 00:01:05.314
Truth is,
we actually have a lot in common.

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:06.607
Don't tell anyone,

00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:12.529
but I love a little scratch
on the spot behind my ears.

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:14.031
You know, right there.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:16.158
The best.

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:22.956
Come on, kitty.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:26.084
[sniffing]

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:29.630
[purring]

00:01:36.137 --> 00:01:38.388
[purring continues]

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:44.436
Yeah. Who's a good kitty?

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.104
- Who's a good kitty?
- [Tarantula] Uh, Wolf?

00:01:46.731 --> 00:01:49.024
Um, you saved him?

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:50.359
[Marmalade] Yes!

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:53.612
Yes, it's working.

00:01:53.696 --> 00:01:54.988
You filmed that?

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:58.075
Yes, and they're starting to like you.

00:01:58.159 --> 00:02:00.035
- Yes!
- All right!

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:03.246
This might just be enough
to win over the guests at the gala.

00:02:03.331 --> 00:02:05.248
- Now we're talking!
- All right!

00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:08.043
[Tarantula]
Yeah, we did it! All right!

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:10.128
[Marmalade] Uh, Wolf?

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:12.547
I must say,
you've really turned a corner.

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.424
- You're really getting it.
- [Wolf] Really?

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:16.218
Oh, thanks.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:19.179
No, I mean it.
I can see it from tip to tail.

00:02:20.765 --> 00:02:23.308
It's just a shame that
you have to carry all that baggage.

00:02:24.519 --> 00:02:26.269
What are you talk...
You mean the guys?

00:02:27.021 --> 00:02:28.146
[Wolf] What do you mean?

00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:29.690
[Marmalade]
You have great potential, Wolf.

00:02:29.774 --> 00:02:31.566
But at some point,
you're going to have to choose

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:33.318
between your friends

00:02:33.403 --> 00:02:34.569
or the good life.

00:02:40.118 --> 00:02:42.160
[Shark, Piranha snoring]

00:02:43.788 --> 00:02:45.580
Hey. You still awake?

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:47.624
[cat meowing]

00:02:47.709 --> 00:02:49.167
You... You brought the cat in?

00:02:49.252 --> 00:02:51.253
Yeah. Yeah.

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:53.296
I'm just savin' it up for later.

00:02:53.381 --> 00:02:54.339
Why, what's up?

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.259
I was just gettin' a little worried

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.720
since you've kinda become a...

00:02:59.804 --> 00:03:00.846
Become a what?

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:03.140
You know, teacher's pet.

00:03:03.224 --> 00:03:05.642
Gettin' all cozy with Marmalade.

00:03:05.727 --> 00:03:07.686
Your tail waggin' and everything.

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.188
Well, yeah,
because it has to be believable.

00:03:10.273 --> 00:03:12.899
Uh-huh. Yeah, I guess so.

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:15.152
As long as it's all part of the plan.

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:18.739
It is all part of the plan, isn't it?

00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:22.242
Snake, buddy,
who made the plan to begin with?

00:03:22.326 --> 00:03:23.326
You did.

00:03:23.411 --> 00:03:26.955
So I'm the one
who sticks to the plan the most, right?

00:03:28.958 --> 00:03:30.500
Yeah, all right. Yeah, okay.

00:03:30.585 --> 00:03:32.419
I guess that makes sense, yeah.

00:03:33.087 --> 00:03:37.883
But if the plan were ever to change,
you'd tell me, right?

00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:42.262
You have my word.

00:03:42.847 --> 00:03:44.181
Go bad...

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:46.641
Or go home.

00:03:55.318 --> 00:03:56.526
Hey, Snake.

00:03:56.611 --> 00:03:57.694
[Snake] Yeah?

00:03:57.779 --> 00:03:59.571
You ever wonder what it'd be like?

00:04:00.156 --> 00:04:02.949
The world loving us
instead of being scared of us?

00:04:03.034 --> 00:04:04.701
You ever... You ever think about that?

00:04:04.786 --> 00:04:05.994
[Snake] Loving us?

00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:07.871
[laughs] Yeah, right.

00:04:07.955 --> 00:04:11.625
I don't waste time thinkin' about stuff
that's never gonna happen.

00:04:11.709 --> 00:04:15.587
[sighs] I can't wait for things
to get back to normal.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:25.555
Yeah. Back to normal, back to normal.

